    "text": "The user is asking in Arabic: \"If I asked you to design a website, what would you do?\"\n\nThis is a conversational question about my approach to designing a website. I should answer in Arabic (per the A …[fixture-truncated]… ign tokens, RTL, etc.\n\nLet me answer concisely in Arabic describing my workflow.",
